<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35416" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνεργ-άζομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make</i> or <i>produce in,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ φορὰ τῆς τοξίτιδος ἐ. τῷ βέλει
					κίνησιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					<u>Bel.</u>
					68.41
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι ἐν τῷ σώματι</span>
			
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπ-</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				22
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι τοῖς ἀνδριᾶσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					3.10.6
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πείθεσθαι τοῖς νόμοις [τῇ
				Σπάρτῃ</span>] ib.<i><span class="en">
				4.4.15
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλοῖς ἔρωτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gorg.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					18
				</span></i>
			; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόξαν</span>] ib.<i><span class="en">
				13
			</span></i>; 
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκπληξιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phlb.</u>
					47a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστήμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Chrysipp.Stoic.
					2.39
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέος τοῖς πολίταις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					60.25
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοχθηρὰς συνηθείας τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					61.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔνοιαν ἐν πᾶσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					6.11a
				</span></i>
			.<i><span class="en">
				7
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.89
			</span></i>, etc.: aor. 1
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνειργάσθην</span> in pass. sense, <i>to
				be made</i> or <i>placed in . .,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				1.4.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>work for hire in,</i> of harlots, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ ἐνεργαζόμεναι παιδίσκαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.93
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τῇ οὐσίᾳ</span>
			<i>trade</i> with the property, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				44.23
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλιεῖς ἐνειργασμένοι τοῖς τόποις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					10.8.7
				</span></i>
			.</div>
